        <li>Battery Council International (BCI) — group size and terminal configuration definitions.</li>
        <li>Vehicle manufacturer electrical system documentation — terminal and orientation conventions.</li>
        <li>Corrosion chemistry and maintenance practice — see the dedicated <a href="/lead-acid/terminal-corrosion/">terminal corrosion</a> page.</li>
